---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="페이지를 찾을 수 없어요 — FlowAgent"
  description="요청하신 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다."
  noIndex={true}
>
  <section>
    <div
      class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-24 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-32"
    >
      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-400"
      >
        404
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-zinc-50"
      >
        페이지를 찾을 수 없어요
      </h1>
      <p
        class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400"
      >
        주소가 잘못됐거나, 페이지가 이동·삭제됐을 수 있어요.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-brand-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-brand-700"
        >
          홈으로
        </a>
        <a
          href="/download"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-50 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800"
        >
          다운로드
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-500">
        Your workflows are <span class="font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">plain YAML files</span>.<br />
        Your data stays on <span class="font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">your machine</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
